    "sub_name": "書報討論(四)",
    "sub_ename": "LITERATURE SURVEY (4)",
    "describe_ch": "藉由參與論文發表與討論，培養學生檢索論文、閱讀論文、整理論文、發表論文之能力，同時使學生熟悉相關論文研究議題與內容",
    "describe_eh": "Through presentation and discussion in the seminars, cultivate students' ability of paper searching、paper reading、and presentation. Also make students be familiar with research topics.",
